{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "crypto-exchange-api-collection",
    "name": "Crypto Exchange Backend API",
    "description": "Complete API collection for Crypto Exchange Backend based on FixedFloat API.\n\n## Authentication\nAll authenticated endpoints require:\n- `X-API-KEY`: Your API key\n- `X-API-SIGN`: HMAC-SHA256 signature of the request body\n\n## Rate Limiting\n- 250 weight units per minute\n- Create order: 50 units\n- Other requests: 1 unit\n\n## Setup\n1. Set `base_url` variable to your server URL\n2. Set `api_key` and `api_secret` variables\n3. The pre-request script will automatically generate signatures",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://localhost:12000",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "api_key",
      "value": "YOUR_API_KEY",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "api_secret",
      "value": "YOUR_API_SECRET",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "// Generate HMAC-SHA256 signature for authenticated requests",
          "if (pm.request.body && pm.request.body.raw) {",
          "    const body = pm.request.body.raw;",
          "    const secret = pm.variables.get('api_secret');",
          "    ",
          "    const signature = CryptoJS.HmacSHA256(body, secret).toString();",
          "    pm.request.headers.add({",
          "        key: 'X-API-SIGN',",
          "        value: signature",
          "    });",
          "}"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Public Endpoints",
      "description": "Endpoints that don't require authentication",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health Check",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/health",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["health"]
            },
            "description": "Check if the API server is running and healthy."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "Success",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "body": "{\n  \"status\": \"healthy\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2025-12-22T10:30:00.000Z\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0.0\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
