            "description": "Handle emergency situations for an order.\n\n**Parameters:**\n- `id`: Order ID\n- `token`: Order token\n- `choice`: Action choice (EXCHANGE, REFUND)\n- `address`: Address for refund (if applicable)\n\n**Weight:** 1 unit\n**Authentication:** Required"
          },
          "response": []
